// - Phase 2a (MANDATORY minimum tokens): After opening span, run a MINIMUM of 8 constrained
//   tokens via SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep WITHOUT calling CloseSpanIfComplete. After minimum
//   tokens, check if span is still "tiny" (|currentConstrainedOut| <= 2) and if so continue.
// - Phase 2b: Try CloseSpanIfComplete with SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep for continuation.
//   Use RollbackAndContinue if dead-end detected.
