//   parser.IsValidPrefix by contract. The invariant holds throughout.
//   Phase 3: CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition: either closed (current=[]) or
//   open valid prefix. Invariant preserved.
//
// progress (|generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps):
//   Phase 1: UnconstrainedChunk grows generated by at most chunkUsed tokens and steps
//   increments by chunkUsed. OpenConstrainedSpan appends 1 token ("<<") and steps += 1.
//   So |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps throughout Phase 1.
//   Phase 2: CloseSpanIfComplete costs 1 step and appends at most 1 token (">>").
//   ConstrainedStep costs 1 step and AppendConstrainedToken appends at most 1 token.
//   Per loop iteration, steps increases by 2 and |generated| grows by at most 1.
//   Since 1 <= 2, the bound |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is preserved.
//   Phase 3: CloseSpanWithinBudget: |generatedOut| <= |generated| + closeBudget,
